# mix-of-capabilities §4.2 / §8.1 P0 — 03×07 aggiornamento del ricordo e
# 03×07×13 il ricordo corretto come operando. Meccanica sulla KB viva: il valore
# e' dell'utente, non un fatto del mondo.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test 03x07 a corrected personal value is recalled as corrected]
!timeout 30
> remember my favorite number is 7
<~ your favorite number is 7
> my favorite number is 11
<~ your favorite number is 11
> what is my favorite number
<~ 11
<! 7

[test 03x07x13 the corrected value is the operand]
!timeout 30
> what is my favorite number plus 3
<~ 14
<! 10

[test forgetting a spoken value removes it from recall and from the calculation]
!timeout 30
> forget that my favorite number is 11
<~ let go of your favorite number
<! Got it
> what is my favorite number plus 3
<! 14
